Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:25.92,Main,,0,0,0,,"Mages' lives in danger"?\N"Curio Company back after 20 years"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:30.08,Main,,0,0,0,,The Curio Company that was\Nin{\i1} The Adventures of Niké{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:34.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Were they released...? Or is it a copycat...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:36.71,Main,,0,0,0,,More importantly, have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.71,0:00:41.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my, it sounds like the group calling\Nthemselves the Curio Company has come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.33,0:00:44.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought they'd been\Nextinguished a long time ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:45.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if my husband will be okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:48.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Will mages be attacked again...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.33,0:00:49.92,Main,,0,0,0,,How frightful...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:52.92,Main,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to avoid anything annoying...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.83,0:01:05.92,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! I don't look\Nanything like a mage now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:08.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm just an ordinary, beautiful woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:12.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, time to go sightseeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.63,0:01:25.96,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"The Two Apprentices"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.29,0:01:39.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll hurry up and get this to\Nthe United Magic Association office
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:41.79,Main,,0,0,0,,and finish up this job!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.79,0:01:44.50,Main,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is give them\Nthis small box and get my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.50,0:01:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It's an easy job!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.29,0:01:47.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:49.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder what she's doing here...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,At a time like this, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:55.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like people are watching me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.29,0:01:59.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess they can't\Nhelp it since I'm so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:06.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.83,0:02:11.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, you...\NYou cute witch girl over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:14.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? You're talking to me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.50,0:02:18.29,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.29,0:02:22.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Witch, this town has\Nhad a lot of trouble recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:24.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Especially if you wear clothes like that--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:28.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Who knows when someone\Nwill decide to attack you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:29.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Attack me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:32.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this town that dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It is. It's terribly dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:38.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? "Terribly dangerous," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:41.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It must be hard, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:43.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You probably don't know this,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.08,0:02:47.04,Main,,0,0,0,,but many mages were attacked here in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:51.50,Main,,0,0,0,,The mages were all shaking in their boots...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.50,0:02:52.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.75,0:02:54.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:03:02.13,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, in order to survive here,\Nmight I suggest Curio--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.13,0:03:08.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, {\i1}Antique {\i0}Company's\Nwonderful self-defense item set?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:11.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Hah, I knew it'd be something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:15.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I turn down all hard sells, so--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.33,0:03:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:39.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, sorry, I couldn't steal the box...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.42,0:03:41.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Useless, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.75,0:03:42.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:45.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Change of plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:50.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We just have to get that small box open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.33,0:04:07.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's see... The association's this way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:25.21,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, no! Am I going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.21,0:04:28.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Quiet! This town is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:45.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Mina? Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:51.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, what are you doing here, Mina?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.71,0:04:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm here on an undercover\Ninvestigation for the association.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,There are some people up to no good...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:05:00.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I haven't infiltrated them, yet, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:02.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Up to no good?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:05.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Big Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:09.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm here for work, too.\NWork. For the association.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.75,0:05:13.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Of all things, work for the association?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:14.88,Main,,0,0,0,,To deliver this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:16.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:17.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:20.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard anything\Nfrom the association, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:32.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's go to my lodgings for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:34.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm just going to deliver this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:36.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want to trouble you,\Nso I'll just stay at an inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.13,0:05:38.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:40.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:43.58,Main,,0,0,0,,If you sigh, happiness escapes, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.71,0:06:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That cafe...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:11.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Could it be the place where Foula\Nmet up with the Curio Company boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:16.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.13,0:06:20.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder which seat Foula sat in...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:23.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.17,0:06:24.96,Main,,0,0,0,,She should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:26.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.25,0:06:28.29,Main,,0,0,0,,She looks dumb,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:33.50,Main,,0,0,0,,so I'm sure she'd just open that box\Nwithout thinking about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:52.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.79,0:06:54.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do anything, Big Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:57.29,Main,,0,0,0,,"Big Sis"? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:07:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Where am I? I thought\NI was in front of the cafe....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.75,0:07:06.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Those guys are planning to\Nattack all the stores in town,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:10.21,Main,,0,0,0,,from jewelry shops to\Nweapons sellers to general stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.21,0:07:12.96,Main,,0,0,0,,This... isn't a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:14.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you listening, Big Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.83,0:07:20.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me. Who are you? I--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:25.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to joke around like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:27.08,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't a joke, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:30.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, my voice seems...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:32.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Sis...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:52.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Sis, what are you--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.63,0:08:13.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Poisonous gas or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.25,0:08:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was so surprised by our\Nfateful meeting that I forgot to breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.75,0:08:50.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Elaina!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:54.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Um... Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:09:00.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Big... Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:05.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling unwell somewhere? Your stomach?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.25,0:09:08.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you have a fever? Or nausea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:12.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.17,0:09:14.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:18.58,Main,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.58,0:09:20.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:26.67,Main,,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:30.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:34.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Sis, I've loved you for a long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:36.25,Main,,0,0,0,,It's strange, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:39.42,Main,,0,0,0,,--But for a long time, you've been\Nthe only thing I could think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.42,0:09:40.17,Main,,0,0,0,,--Wai--\N--But for a long time, you've been\Nthe only thing I could think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.17,0:09:40.71,Main,,0,0,0,,--Wai--\N--Even though you're my big sister,\Nyou follow me, your little sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:43.96,Main,,0,0,0,,--Even though you're my big sister,\Nyou follow me, your little sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.96,0:09:47.50,Main,,0,0,0,,around like a dog, relying on me.\NYou're a pitiful, unreliable big sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:51.29,Main,,0,0,0,,but oh, you're so, so, so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:55.58,Main,,0,0,0,,So, so, so, so cute, I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:10:00.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Jeez! I don't need anything\Nother than you in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I always treat\Nyou coldly despite that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But I really love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:10.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I couldn't be honest with my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:16.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I actually love you so much\NI could eat you up! I love, love, love, love,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.42,0:10:20.42,Main,,0,0,0,,love, love, love, love, love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:22.08,Main,,0,0,0,,So please...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.17,Main,,0,0,0,,With me--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:39.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Oof.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.63,0:10:43.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what's going on...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:49.33,Main,,0,0,0,,--Wait!\N--I love you!\N--Don't come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:51.04,Main,,0,0,0,,--You're acting weird!\N--Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:52.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I adore you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:54.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The one I love is your little brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:55.33,Main,,0,0,0,,--I love you! I love you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.33,0:10:57.54,Main,,0,0,0,,--Your feelings are enough!\N--I love you! I love you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.54,0:10:58.33,Main,,0,0,0,,--Don't come near me!\N--Oh, I love you! Please go out with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:11:00.21,Main,,0,0,0,,--Wait a minute!\N--What's the matter? You seem scary!\N--Don't come near me!\N--Oh, I love you! Please go out with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:01.29,Main,,0,0,0,,--Wait a minute!\N--What's the matter? You seem scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:08.25,Main,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:14.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It's probably--no, it's without\Na doubt--because I opened the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:15.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I love--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:17.13,Main,,0,0,0,,This voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:19.13,Main,,0,0,0,,--No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.13,0:11:21.29,Main,,0,0,0,,--Come on!\N--No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:27.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You really are cute. You're so\Ncute no matter how I look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-That appearance...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:32.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Love...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:35.71,Main,,0,0,0,,That's me no matter how you look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.63,0:11:41.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Saya...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:43.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.17,0:11:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:51.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.04,0:11:55.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:12:00.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing is making sense! Explain yourself, Saya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.13,0:12:02.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:06.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Before I knew it, I had turned\Ninto such a cute Miss Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:11.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, I don't know why the rest of\Nthe town has ended up like this, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.79,0:12:16.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that part's fine. I know why that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.21,0:12:18.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:21.58,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, about why we've switched bodies...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.58,0:12:26.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean you know\Nwhy the town ended up like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:29.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's leave that aside for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:32.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I should've had a box with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:38.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It contained something dangerous\Nand that should never be opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.71,0:12:42.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.17,0:12:47.88,Main,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:51.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you opened it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:52.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:54.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.29,0:12:59.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing? Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:03.25,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything good would\Ncome of opening something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:06.04,Main,,0,0,0,,My little sister didn't stop you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:06.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.96,0:13:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Wasn't she there?\NA strangely sexy girl with black hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:14.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, there was...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.75,0:13:17.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You sisters are really similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.75,0:13:26.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Really? No, we're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:32.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you please not make\Nthat expression with my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:34.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What expression?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.79,0:13:37.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:41.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Please get away from the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.79,0:13:46.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna! I wanna stay\Nwith you for the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.42,0:13:52.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Our first priority right now should\Nbe to get this city back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:56.67,Main,,0,0,0,,No, not "our"--{\i1}my {\i0}first priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.67,0:13:59.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It was my fault to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, since I'm you right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:04.79,Main,,0,0,0,,we can say I should do it, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.79,0:14:07.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful, but please\Nget away from the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:11.79,Main,,0,0,0,,But what was inside that box, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:13.92,Main,,0,0,0,,More of a curse than magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.92,0:14:16.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Probably something like a love potion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.46,0:14:21.08,Main,,0,0,0,,So someone switched us and\Nthen made you open it, or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.08,0:14:23.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Would someone really make such a sloppy plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:27.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right. That's too sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:32.00,Main,,0,0,0,,As the boss planned,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:37.21,Main,,0,0,0,,a witch nonchalantly brought the\Nsmall box that was confiscated in the past
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,believing it was a job for\Nthe United Magic Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't steal the box from the witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.63,0:14:46.08,Main,,0,0,0,,but when we switched\Nthe witch with a foolish girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:49.21,Main,,0,0,0,,the girl opened the box for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:52.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, the whole town is in chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:55.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, go steal! The effect\Nof the smoke won't last for long!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:57.58,Main,,0,0,0,,All of you of the revived Curio Company!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:15:01.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Steal as much as you can right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.21,0:15:06.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:10.54,Main,,0,0,0,,your sister said something about\Nsome people attacking the stores...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Those people are...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:16.33,Main,,0,0,0,,The Curio Company has been revived, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.33,0:15:18.83,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the Curio Company?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:20.79,Main,,0,0,0,,In the book, {\i1}The Adventures of Niké{\i0}--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:22.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've never read it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:24.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:28.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's pretty sloppy, but\Nall the mysteries have been solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:38.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, uh, I'm sorry for getting carried away...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:45.33,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as you tell us where\Nthe leader of the Curio Company is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.04,0:16:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, we headed to the place the nice man\Ntold us about, where the leader was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:04.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What? But it was the perfect plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:07.33,Main,,0,0,0,,No, it was extremely sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:11.25,Main,,0,0,0,,But, Miss Elaina, you were\Ncompletely tricked, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Even so, I never thought\NI'd also be able to capture
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:20.04,Main,,0,0,0,,the Curio Company boss\Nfrom {\i1}The Adventures of Niké{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:21.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:26.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, we want you to\Nput our bodies back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.54,0:16:30.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm totally fine staying like this, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.58,0:16:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We want you to put our bodies back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:35.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I can't do it right away...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:37.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.17,0:16:40.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-They should go back in about a day...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:42.79,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:44.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Sniff...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.29,0:16:45.46,Main,,0,0,0,,However!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:46.92,Main,,0,0,0,,However?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:49.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't think that you've won!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:51.33,Main,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:55.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Dozens more than the ones you caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:59.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Right about now, the chaos\Nin town should be multiplying,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:04.54,Main,,0,0,0,,with everyone stealing\Nwhat they can and escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:07.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Too bad! We win!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:09.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:11.63,Main,,0,0,0,,All we can do is split up and search, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:14.13,Main,,0,0,0,,No, there's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.13,0:17:15.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.00,0:17:19.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Fran?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.17,0:17:21.13,Main,,0,0,0,,T-Teach?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.13,0:17:23.25,Main,,0,0,0,,"Teach"? You mean Sheila?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.25,0:17:27.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Long time no see,\Nfanged leader of the Curio Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:29.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.17,0:17:31.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You're that apprentice witch from that time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.71,0:17:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,"From that time"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:36.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my, your fangs are now... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:37.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.67,0:17:41.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about the Curio Company\Nguys going crazy outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:43.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We've already taken care of all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:47.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Too bad. You lost again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:48.92,Main,,0,0,0,,"Again"...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, what do we need to do to\Nget the townspeople back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.88,0:18:07.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is she unconscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:28.08,Main,,0,0,0,,And now, the townspeople are back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:30.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It was actually pretty easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:33.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is she unconscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.17,0:18:43.67,Main,,0,0,0,,About that box...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.67,0:18:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Was it brought from an island\Nfar beyond the horizon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:49.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.88,0:18:54.58,Main,,0,0,0,,As expected of Miss Elaina! You sure know a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.58,0:19:00.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Were we also switched\Nbecause of an item from that island?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:09.38,Main,,0,0,0,,When you see a person you kind of like,\Nyou can't act normal anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.38,0:19:13.83,Main,,0,0,0,,and when you see someone\Nyou {\i1}really {\i0}like, you become hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:15.63,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the curse on that smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:18.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:20.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:24.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.63,0:19:25.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.96,0:19:28.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I have heard about you from my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.17,0:19:31.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard that you taught\Nher magic after I left her,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,and that you found each\Nother again in another country.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.58,0:19:39.04,Main,,0,0,0,,She sounded so happy when she talked about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:44.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, why did you leave Saya in the Land of Mages?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.75,0:19:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,She was pretty depressed, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.67,0:19:53.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's because I wanted to start\Nher training as a witch right away,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:57.67,Main,,0,0,0,,so I forced her to go back to her homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.67,0:19:59.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You did, Sheila?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:01.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Mina's teacher, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.96,0:20:03.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.50,0:20:05.33,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.33,0:20:08.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Saya has a tendency to depend on people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.46,0:20:13.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It didn't seem like it would be good\Nfor either of them to always be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:17.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. I thought for sure it was\Nbecause Mina was tired of Saya
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.21,0:20:20.29,Main,,0,0,0,,and left her behind to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.29,0:20:23.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, Mina wouldn't let me hear\Nthe end of it when she got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.67,0:20:26.63,Main,,0,0,0,,She said stuff like\N"Why did you make me leave my sister?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.63,0:20:28.63,Main,,0,0,0,,and "I'll never forgive you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.63,0:20:31.21,Main,,0,0,0,,and "I'll curse you my whole life!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.21,0:20:33.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? Mina said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:36.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, that's unexpected--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:41.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, based on what happened\Nyesterday, it's not unexpected at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:42.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.83,0:20:46.92,Main,,0,0,0,,This makes it hard to tell who\Nwas depending on whom, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:50.96,Main,,0,0,0,,P-Please stop talking about it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.33,0:21:01.50,Main,,0,0,0,,No! I don't wanna! I don't wanna go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:06.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna stay with Miss Elaina!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.38,0:21:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:09.75,Main,,0,0,0,,There's work to do, so we're leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:11.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Then how will you eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.71,0:21:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll have Miss Elaina make me her bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:18.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.75,0:21:20.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You heard her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.21,0:21:23.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Sis, give it up--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.21,0:21:27.08,Main,,0,0,0,,She's looking at me hostilely.\NReally hostilely...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.08,0:21:28.25,Main,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.25,0:21:31.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, see you in a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.25,0:21:35.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:41.67,Main,,0,0,0,,No... Miss Elaina!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.67,0:21:44.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You are very loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:46.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.92,0:21:49.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.38,0:21:50.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:53.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You've realized, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:55.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Realized what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.54,0:21:58.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Who my teacher was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.04,0:22:01.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Your teacher? Who...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:06.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like you still can't be honest\Nwith yourself about the important things.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:09.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have any problems the way I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.67,0:22:13.17,Main,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't hurt to fix\Nthat part of yourself, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.17,0:22:16.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I still want to keep traveling,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:18.96,Main,,0,0,0,,and I still want to visit lots of countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:24.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll leisurely do the things I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.33,0:22:31.58,Main,,0,0,0,,If I realize...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like my days of\Ntraveling freely will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.54,0:22:41.17,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter who has influenced you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.17,0:22:43.50,Main,,0,0,0,,or whether or not you've realized who that is,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:46.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think anything will change, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.58,0:22:48.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:50.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I do. Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.67,0:22:54.04,Main,,0,0,0,,My teacher always seemed\Nlike she acted in a calculating way,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.04,0:22:56.42,Main,,0,0,0,,but she was actually pretty laid-back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.42,0:22:57.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.67,0:22:59.92,Main,,0,0,0,,And you are also pretty laid-back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.92,0:23:01.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.96,0:23:07.21,Main,,0,0,0,,So I don't think you need\Nto care about the small things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.21,0:23:12.29,Main,,0,0,0,,But one of these days, please go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.58,0:23:14.88,Main,,0,0,0,,One of these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.88,0:23:16.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.46,0:23:20.42,Main,,0,0,0,,We're always thinking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:22.96,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll always love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:26.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Me, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.38,0:23:30.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I love you, Miss Fran. And everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.54,0:23:37.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.46,0:23:44.46,Main,,0,0,0,,There are five volumes\Nin The Adventures of Niké.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.46,0:23:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want my story to end in five volumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.17,0:23:51.71,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:23:57.38,Main,,0,0,0,,In the country where Miss Fran and Sheila\Nwere able to be honest with each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.38,0:24:01.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I took a new step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.63,0:24:05.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to keep being just the Ashen Witch--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.46,0:24:08.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Just an ordinary traveler.
